  "title": "The Summer Concert Story Nobody Is Telling",
  "summary": "Spend five minutes scrolling social media or reading headlines and it's easy to conclude this summer's concert season is being defined by blockbuster tours, premium experiences and eye-popping resale prices. That's certainly part of the story. But it's far from the whole story. The bigger shift happening in live entertainment…",
